{
  "name": "@wick/tv-vega",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Roger Bavibidila",
  "main": "index.js",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "react-native build-vega --build-type Release",
    "build:debug": "react-native build-vega --build-type Debug",
    "start": "react-native start",
    "test": "vitest run"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@amazon-devices/headless-task-manager": "^1.2.8",
    "@amazon-devices/kepler-content-personalization": "^1.3.3",
    "@amazon-devices/kepler-file-system": "^0.0.7",
    "@amazon-devices/kepler-media-controls": "^1.0.25",
    "@amazon-devices/kepler-ui-components": "^3.2.2",
    "@amazon-devices/react-native-kepler": "^4.0.1",
    "@amazon-devices/react-native-w3cmedia": "^2.3.2",
    "@wick/contracts": "*",
    "@wick/vega-calm-ui": "*",
    "mqtt": "^5.10.0",
    "react": "^19.3.0",
    "react-native": "0.83.0",
    "@babel/runtime": "^7.25.0"
  },
  "comment:dependencies": [
    "Vega SDK packages install from the public npm registry as normal deps.",
    "CORRECTION 2026-09-19: the earlier assumption here (that",
    "react-native-kepler replaces 'react-native' entirely, so installing",
    "'react-native' too would conflict) does not match the Vega CLI's own",
    "generated scaffold (`vega project generate --template helloWorld`,",
    "CLI 1.3.4 / SDK 0.24.12044) \u2014 that reference project depends on both",
    "'react-native' 0.83.0 (core JS components: View, StyleSheet, Text, ...)",
    "and '@amazon-devices/react-native-kepler' (Vega-specific extras like",
    "TVFocusGuideView) side by side, and imports AppRegistry from",
    "'react-native', not react-native-kepler. Pin the exact version",
    "(0.83.0, not ^) \u2014 react-native-kepler's own version string",
    "(4.0.1+rn0.83.0) encodes which RN version it's built against; drifting",
    "off it is exactly the kind of plausible-but-wrong assumption FL-007",
    "already cost a day on once.",
    "Not yet installed, add when the feature that needs them lands:",
    "  @amazon-devices/kepler-performance-api",
    "  @amazon-devices/keplerscript-audio-lib",
    "  @amazon-devices/keplerscript-netmgr-lib",
    "  @amazon-devices/react-native-reanimated",
    "  @amazon-devices/react-native-worklets",
    "  @amazon-devices/react-native-safe-area-context",
    "  @amazon-devices/react-native-svg",
    "  @amazon-devices/eslint-plugin-kepler"
  ],
  "devDependencies": {
    "@amazon-devices/kepler-cli-platform": "^0",
    "@react-native-community/cli": "20.0.0",
    "@react-native/babel-preset": "0.83.0",
    "@react-native/metro-config": "0.83.0",
    "@react-native/typescript-config": "0.83.0",
    "@types/react": "^19.3.0"
  },
  "kepler": {
    "projectType": "application",
    "appName": "Wick",
    "targets": ["tv"]
  }
}
